# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
bin/*
Dockerfile.cross

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Go workspace file
go.work

# Kubernetes Generated files - skip generated files, except for vendored files
!vendor/**/zz_generated.*

# editor and IDE paraphernalia
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Kubeconfig might contain secrets
*.kubeconfig

# AI agent session memory — contains PII and cross-project data, never publish
docs/session-memory/

# Session handoff notes — contain private IPs, hostnames, multi-project context
docs/HANDOFF-*.md

# Sprint VM provisioning docs — contain internal IPs, kubeadm tokens, lab topology
docs/sprints/SPRINT*-VM-*.md

# Compiled binaries at repo root
# NOTE: these MUST be anchored with a leading '/'. A bare name like `agent` (unanchored)
# matches every path component of that name anywhere in the tree — the bare `agent` pattern
# was silently gitignoring the entire internal/agent/ package, which is why prior unit-test
# files under internal/agent/server were "gitignored, never committed" (Workstream-40C).
/local_gate
/pm-cni
/fleetctl
/agent
/hack/gate-workload/gate-server

# macOS artifacts
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Claude Code project files
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Internal strategy docs — live locally only, never committed or pushed
docs/AGENTIC_STRATEGY.md
docs/AGENTIC_STRATEGY_*.md

# Internal delivery-process corpus — sprint plans, review logs, personas, process docs
# These document the internal delivery process and must never be published
docs/sprints/
docs/personas/
docs/audit/
docs/review/
docs/postmortems/
docs/process/
docs/chaos/
docs/cncf/
docs/compliance/
docs/memory/

# Internal sprint handoff/evidence charters — carry internal delivery-process matter
# (planning-role rosters, process-section citations); live locally only, never committed.
docs/SPRINT-43-HANDOFF.md
docs/LIVE-E2E-EVIDENCE-2026-07-10.md

# Internal resumption state file (process engine, never public)
docs/proof/*-STATE.yaml

# All internal process records (relocated out of the public tree — local only)
.internal/

# Stray sprint-gate / checkpoint / proposal scratch artifacts (never publish)
SPRINT*-PHASE-*-GATE-*.md
docs/adr/PROOF_NS5_BETA_SPRINT_GATE.md

# Internal process/governance ADRs — local only, never public
docs/adr/0205-principal-architect-agent.md
docs/adr/0206-*.md
docs/adr/0207-grounding-obligation-constitutional.md
docs/adr/ADR-0226-*.md

